                                                "example_id": "06e087a0-7710-4c90-acc1-9bff752753fe",
                                                "sense_id": "978089d5-43ce-3195-862c-bcb45af70027",
                                                "text": "Per.[igot] VVell decked in a frocke of gray, / Will.[y] hey ho, gray is greet, / Per. And in a kirtle of greene ſaye, / Will. the greene is for maydens meete."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b219794-b0d5-41fd-8859-3984bfed794c",
                                                "sense_id": "978089d5-43ce-3195-862c-bcb45af70027",
                                                "text": "All in a kirtle of diſcolourd ſay / He clothed was […]"
